### rex runtime data ###
# .rex/ mixes declared content meant to be committed (enabled.yml, REX.md, skills/,
# marketplaces/*/plugins/ — mirrors package.json vs node_modules) with local/derived content:
# config.yml may hold secrets, marketplaces/*/cache/ is install-time binary content synced from
# plugins/ by `/plugin install`. Only the latter stays ignored, so project scope's declared parts
# are actually shareable via git.
.rex/*
!.rex/enabled.yml
!.rex/REX.md
!.rex/skills/
!.rex/marketplaces/
.rex/marketplaces/*/cache/